## 22. Success Criteria

wardOS v0 is successful if:

- A presidency member can log in and see the current state of quorum operations.
- Lessons, service opportunities, and cleaning assignments are easier to manage than in the current sheet.
- A service or cleaning signup form can be created and shared.
- The Sunday program can be drafted, published, and viewed from a public QR-friendly link.
- A presidency meeting can be run with agenda items and action items.
- Sensitive member information is not imported or stored.
- The app is useful enough to try for one full Sunday cycle.

